ocument:0:685:0","kind":"document","source_node_id":"0","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"（娟秀工整的字迹）\n很久很久以前，在赛凡纳城市的正中央，矗立着一位王子的雕像。\n雕像王子身披金箔，眼眸和剑柄上装点着比海都要蓝的、闪闪发亮的宝石，他是那么神气，那么漂亮，城市里的所有人都爱雕像王子。\n雕像王子用蓝宝石的眼睛看见了形形色色的、悲惨又艰辛的人，忧愁侵占了他的心房，他漂亮的眼睛不由得流下了迤逦的、晶莹的泪珠。\n一只燕子从遥远的南方飞来，衔起了他的泪珠。和城市里的人们一样，燕子如此轻易地就爱上了雕像王子。\n“燕子啊，帮我把宝石和金箔送给那些需要它们的人吧。我只是一座铅心的雕像，要这些又有什么用呢？”雕像王子恳求道。\n燕子照做了。它衔着雕像王子身上的宝石和金箔，一次次飞过贫民窟的屋顶，为穷苦的人们带去温暖与希望。而雕像王子自己，却变得越来越黯淡。\n冬天很快就要来了。冰冷的霜雪即将覆盖城市的每一个角落。\n“王子啊，我很快就要冻死在这里了，”燕子虚弱地靠在雕像王子的脚边，“但我宁愿冻死，也要陪着你。”\n雕像王子看着瑟瑟发抖的燕子，那颗铅做的心突然感到了恐惧。他害怕自己将要独自面对漫长的冬天，更害怕看到燕子死在自己脚下。\n“不，燕子，你必须走，”雕像王子的声音不再像以前那样温柔了，“我不需要你的陪伴。你留在这里，只会提醒我已经失去了所有的金箔和宝石，提醒我已经变得多么丑陋和无用！”\n“可是，王子……”\n“走吧！飞到你温暖的南方去！”雕像王子严厉地命令道，“不要再回来了！”\n燕子伤心欲绝地拍打着翅膀。它最后看了一眼那个曾经光芒万丈、如今却灰暗斑驳的雕像，发出了一声悲鸣，转身飞向了天空，再也没有回来。\n冬天终于降临了。\n雪花落满了雕像王子光秃秃的头顶。他失去了所有的宝石，失去了美丽的伪装，也失去了唯一愿意陪伴他的好友。\n他依然高高矗立着，微笑俯瞰着这座城市。只是那笑容，再也不会变化了。\n他变成了一座真正的、只有铅心的雕像。","textdes_id":"685","document_page_count":"1","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"1","document_object_id":"0","document_item_id":"0","document_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item5","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"UI/Prefabs/StoryReadItem/items/pbui_map_story_detail_item5.prefab","document_pic":"","document_gender":"false"},"say:1:1739900401:1":{"key":"say:1:1739900401:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"1","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1739900401","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"这则以娟秀工整的字迹书写的故事，在赛凡纳广为流传，连你...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:2:1739900402:1":{"key":"say:2:1739900402:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"2","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1739900402","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"不知为何，与曾经听过的故事相比，你觉得这则故事读起来格...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:3:1739900403:1":{"key":"say:3:1739900403:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"3","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1739900403","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"怀揣着好奇，你翻开了日记本的下一页。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"document:4:686:0":{"key":"document:4:686:0","kind":"document","source_node_id":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"（稚嫩的字迹）\n飞鸟为什么要离开？飞鸟为什么再也没有回来？我问母亲，母亲没有回答。\n讲完故事，母亲又要去远足了。我一个人，学习写字。\n母亲说我很聪明，不是所有孩子都像我一样会写字。\n母亲好像喜欢外面，不喜欢宫殿，她总是抬头看着▇▇。\n外面又下雨了，今天是▇▇不那么快乐的一天。","textdes_id":"686","document_page_count":"1","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"1","document_object_id":"0","document_item_id":"0","document_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item5","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"UI/Prefabs/StoryReadItem/items/pbui_map_story_detail_item5.prefab","document_pic":"","document_gender":"false"},"say:5:1739900404:1":{"key":"say:5:1739900404:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1739900404","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"眼前的文字字迹稚嫩，显然与之前工整娟秀的文字非一人所写。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1739900405:0":{"key":"say:6:1739900405:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1739900405","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"母亲和孩子……你心中暗自对前后两位书写者的身份有了猜测。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1739900406:0":{"key":"say:7:1739900406:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1739900406","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"可这样的日记本为什么会出现在鹰瞳之塔呢？怀着探究的心情...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"document:8:687:0":{"key":"document:8:687:0","kind":"document","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"（稚嫩的字迹）\n她从那么高的地方坠落下来……全身的骨头都变形了……\n为什么？为什么会这样？！死神，我们做错了什么？你为什么要把她从我身边夺走？！\n仁慈的▇▇在上，救救她吧，她好痛，好痛……\n……\n……\n<style=\"highlight\">她</style>不在了。世界上除了我之外，唯一知道▇▇▇▇的人，不在了。\n再也没有人能给我讲故事，再也没有人会在下雨天紧紧抱住我了。\n我必须自己保护自己。听她的话，把那个恶毒的<style=\"highlight\">诅咒</style>藏起来，不要让任何人发现……哪怕是▇▇也不行。\n我必须要忍耐。等到我长大，查出究竟是谁在暗中下了▇▇，等到我亲手把那个人揪出来的那一天……\n到那个时候，我就自由了。","textdes_id":"687","document_page_count":"1","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"1","document_object_id":"0","document_item_id":"0","document_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item5","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"UI/Prefabs/StoryReadItem/items/pbui_map_story_detail_item5.prefab","document_pic":"","document_gender":"false"},"say:9:1739900407:1":{"key":"say:9:1739900407:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1739900407","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"“坠落”……“诅咒”……“她不在了”……日记中的这些词...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:10:1739900408:1":{"key":"say:10:1739900408:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"10","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1739900408","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"因为一次坠落，书写日记的孩子失去了某个重要的人，而这位...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:11:1739900409:0":{"key":"say:11:1739900409:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"11","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1739900409","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"“她”会是上文中的母亲吗？日记里提到的“诅咒”又是什么...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"document:12:688:0":{"key":"document:12:688:0","kind":"document","source_node_id":"12","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"这里到处都是刺鼻的花香和虚伪的笑声，空置了那么久的卧房，终于还是迎来了新的女主人。\n她竟然是一名▇▇▇。\n父亲明明比谁都清楚那个▇▇▇会动摇耀光王储之位的传闻，可他还是娶了她。他的心里，到底把我放在了什么位置？\n我不能问，更不能表现出哪怕一丝一毫的不满。\n母亲教过我，感到恐惧和愤怒时，要▇▇比任何人都灿烂。\n不管内心怎么想……我必须表现得……甚至比往常更好。我要让所有的……甚至▇▇，都觉得我是最完美的人选。\n只有成为他们希望看到的……才不会引起任何人的怀疑。▇▇，才最安全。","textdes_id":"688","document_page_count":"1","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"1","document_object_id":"0","document_item_id":"0","document_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item5","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"UI/Prefabs/StoryReadItem/items/pbui_map_story_detail_