"},"document:17:689:0":{"key":"document:17:689:0","kind":"document","source_node_id":"17","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"那个穿黑袍的▇▇▇，最近出现得太频繁了。\n他总是在我一个人看书或者练剑的时候恰好出现，说一些似是而非的恭维话。\n他到底想干什么？我该相信他吗？\n他是个▇▇▇，这就足够让我警惕了。那个女人也是▇▇▇，他们是不是串通好的？是不是想从我身上看出什么破绽？\n可是……他是<style=\"highlight\">黑</style>▇▇▇家族举荐来的。▇▇▇▇▇家族一直最为坚定地支持我，照理说，我不应该怀疑他的立场。\n他今天看我的眼神，好像知道些什么。我真的可以利用他吗？","textdes_id":"689","document_page_count":"1","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"1","document_object_id":"0","document_item_id":"0","document_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item5","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"UI/Prefabs/StoryReadItem/items/pbui_map_story_detail_item5.prefab","document_pic":"","document_gender":"false"},"say:18:1739900414:1":{"key":"say:18:1739900414:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"18","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1739900414","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"看着这段文字，迪尔格雷的形象几乎是立刻浮现在了你的面前...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:19:1739900415:1":{"key":"say:19:1739900415:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"19","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1739900415","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"他也好，奥利安也好，究竟为什么会在他们身上发生这一切？...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:20:1739900416:1":{"key":"say:20:1739900416:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"20","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1739900416","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你叹了一口气，继续往后